# DataEngine Optimized Docker Ignore
# Excludes unnecessary files to speed up Docker builds

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.github

# Development environment
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.vscode
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget

# Build artifacts and caches
**/target/**
**/node_modules/**
**/.cargo/**

# Documentation and non-essential files
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/docs/**
**/*.md
!DOCKER.md

# Test files
**/tests/**
**/*_test.rs
**/*_tests.rs

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.*~

# OS specific files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# IDE files
*.suo
*.user
*.sln.docstates

# Log files
**/*.log
**/logs/**

# Docker related files (avoid recursion)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore

# Scripts and tools (not needed in container)
**/scripts/**
**/tools/**
**/*.sh
**/*.bat
**/*.ps1

# Kubernetes manifests
**/k8s/**
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
!docker-compose.yml

# Backup files
**/*.bak
**/*.backup

# Development dependencies
**/examples/**
**/benches/**
**/bin/**
**/.cargo/**
**/node_modules/**
**/npm-debug.log

# Documentation and examples  
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/docs/**
**/examples/**
**/notebooks/**
**/benchmarks/**

# Test files
**/tests/**
**/*_test.rs
**/*_tests.rs
# Note: Do NOT use **/*test*.rs as it excludes files like backtest_result.rs

# Docker and deployment files
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml
**/k8s/**
**/helm/**
**/charts/**
**/scripts/**

# Database migrations (will be handled via init scripts)
**/migrations/**

# Configuration files that shouldn't be in image
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/.env*
**/config.local.*

# Logs and temporary files
**/logs/**
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# IDE specific
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/*.*proj.user
**/.classpath

# OS specific
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store

# Performance: Only include essential workspace members
# Exclude other engines that DataEngine doesn't directly need
/BacktestingEngine/examples/**
/BacktestingEngine/tests/**
/BacktestingEngine/notebooks/**
/SignalEngine/examples/**
/SignalEngine/tests/**
/SimulationEngine/examples/**
/SimulationEngine/tests/**

# Keep essential dependencies but exclude their non-essential parts
/databaseschema/examples/**
/databaseschema/docs/**
/LoggingEngine/examples/**
/LoggingEngine/docs/**
/MessageBrokerEngine/examples/**
/MessageBrokerEngine/docs/**
/redisutils/examples/**
/redisutils/docs/**
